Number 100000 has 6 digits

26
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:23,350
Number 99988 has 5 digits

27
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:34,910
We have number 100000 larger than number 99988

28
00:04:34,910 --> 00:04:56,680
If two numbers have the same number of digits, compare each pair of digits in the same place, from left to right.

29
00:04:58,110 --> 00:05:05,440
To compare two numbers we do as follows

30
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:19,170
Number 8000 and number 7999 both have 4 digits

31
00:05:19,170 --> 00:05:34,770
Number 8000 is larger than number 7999 because in the thousands place there is 8 larger than 7

32
00:05:34,770 --> 00:05:50,530
