33
00:05:50,530 --> 00:06:04,930
Compare two numbers 84200 and number 84159

34
00:06:05,860 --> 00:06:12,950
To compare these two numbers we do as follows

35
00:06:12,950 --> 00:06:22,950
Number 84200 has 5 digits

36
00:06:22,950 --> 00:06:32,840
Number 84159 has 5 digits

37
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:51,660
Since the two numbers have the same number of digits, same ten-thousands digit is 8, same thousands digit is 4, hundreds digit is 2 greater than 1.

38
00:06:51,660 --> 00:07:04,170
So 84200 is larger than 84159

